<title>USA: Nova Tech sells 500,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Nova Tech sells 500,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, Conn. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nova Technologies Inc said on Tuesday it had completed the sale of 500,000 shares of registered stock at $2.00 per share to TimeCapital Securities Corp, of Port Jefferson Station, N.Y.</p>
<p>Nova said it has developed an automatic patient transfer system called Novabed for use in institutional and homecare settings.</p>
<p>The system automatically, comfortably and safely transfers a bedridden patient to and from a hospital type bed and a wheelchair or commode, the company said.</p>
<p>As of the end of August, Nova Technologies had 6,411,183 shares outstanding, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
